    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"4.9 from 2,092 Google reviews\",\"title\":\"What patients and parents say\",\"lede\":\"A mix of feedback given to us directly, immediately after the circumcision, and reviews left publicly on Google. The figure above was checked on 2 September 2026 and we refresh it quarterly.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Testimonials\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022rating-badge\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026amp;query=Beverley+Clinic+Edgware\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022reviews-read-testimonials\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cspan class=\\u0022score\\u0022\\u003e4.9\\u003c/span\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cspan class=\\u0022txt\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRead all 2,092 on Google\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOpens Google Maps in a new tab\\u003c/span\\u003e\\n\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022rating-badge\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://www.cqc.org.uk/location/1-2192226003\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022cqc-read-testimonials\\u0022\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cspan class=\\u0022score\\u0022 style=\\u0022font-size:22px\\u0022\\u003eCQC\\u003c/span\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cspan class=\\u0022txt\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRegistered and rated Good\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCare Quality Commission, new tab\\u003c/span\\u003e\\n\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/video-grid {\"items\":[]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"In their own words\",\"heading\":\"Feedback given to us on the day\",\"lede\":\"These were left by name on our public reviews. We have not edited them beyond trimming for length.\",\"display\":\"d-1\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/quotes-grid {\"quotes\":[{\"name\":\"Mustafa Butt\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision, three weeks old\",\"quote\":\"The receptionist explained the procedure clearly and put us at ease straight away. The doctor was thorough and professional, explained everything beforehand, and stayed calm and reassuring throughout. He took the time to go through the aftercare in detail.\"},{\"name\":\"Wajahat Murtaza\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision\",\"quote\":\"Smooth and efficient from start to finish. Dr Haidar is professional and experienced, we were given all the information we needed, and a follow-up call was made as well, which is a nice thing to do. The ring came off after a week and my son is doing well.\"},{\"name\":\"Sara Salmanpour\",\"context\":\"Baby circumcision, two months old\",\"quote\":\"As first-time parents we were naturally anxious, but the team made us feel completely at ease. The doctor explained the procedure in detail and answered every concern with patience. They gave us the option to contact them any time afterwards, which was a huge relief.\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eWhy it matters to us\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-1\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-1\">Most people here were sent by somebody they trust</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The great majority of our patients come by word of mouth, from family and friends whose sons we have\n          already circumcised. That is how this clinic has grown, and it is a harder thing to earn than a good\n          advert.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>What we notice most is the families who come back. Some return after many years, whenever there is a new\n          son. Others bring a brother, then a nephew, then a cousin. We have families we have now seen across three\n          children and the better part of a decade.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>None of that survives one bad experience, which is the honest reason we do the things we do: the test\n          before we start, the call the day after, the follow-ups that stay free until you are healed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything\",\"formId\":\"testimonials\",\"subject\":\"testimonials page enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:cil/callout {\"title\":\"No superlatives on this website\",\"body\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou will not find rankings or comparative claims about other clinics anywhere here.\\n      Claims of that kind have to be substantiated with evidence held before publication, health services are held to\\n      a stricter standard under the CAP Code, and they are worth considerably less than a fact you can check\\n      yourself.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n      \\u003cp\\u003eSo instead: 4.9 from 2,092 Google reviews,\\n      checked on 2 September 2026. Registered with the Care Quality Commission and rated\\n      Good, report public. Two practitioners named on this site with their qualifications. Every one of\\n      those can be checked, and three of them without asking us.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"urgent\":false,\"level\":2} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"eyebrow\":\"Talk to us\",\"title\":\"Ask us anything before you decide\",\"text\":\"Most people call with a question rather than to book. That is what the phone is for, and nothing is booked until you say so.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Book a consultation\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\",\"phoneLabel\":\"Call 020 8951 3794\",\"phoneUrl\":\"tel:+442089513794\",\"cardTitle\":\"Would you rather write than speak?\",\"cardHtml\":\"\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eA phone call asks you to be fluent and composed in the moment. \\u003ca href=\\u0022https://wa.me/447886779958\\u0022 rel=\\u0022noopener\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022whatsapp-cta\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep)\\u0022\\u003eWhatsApp\\u003c/a\\u003e does not. You can take your time, translate, and forward the answer to whoever else in the family needs to see it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:12px\\u0022\\u003eWe reply during opening hours, and we are used to the questions people feel awkward asking out loud.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->"
}
